    "The branch is not safe to merge wholesale; recover only changes proven missing and still correct on the current target.",
    "This package records evidence and open acceptance work without treating conversation-local implementation as canonical completion.",
    "Next: reconcile the eight unique commits, selectively recover on a fresh target-based branch, then run focused tests/build and desktop/mobile visual checks."
